OL,3,GNEWSAArbroath sex attacker may have
OL,4,Abeen a dog walker
OL,5,
OL,6,FPolice have said a man who sexually
OL,7,Fassaulted a 38-year-old woman in
OL,8,FArbroath may have been a dog walker.
OL,10,FOfficers were called to Arbirlot Road
OL,11,Fnear Monymusk Road at about 06:10.
OL,13,FThe suspect was described as white,
OL,14,Faged between 18 and 30, with blonde
OL,15,Fhair tied in a bun. He spoke with a
OL,16,Flocal accent.
OL,18,FHe was wearing a dark hooded top and
OL,19,Fbaseball cap and may have been walking
OL,20,Fa tan-coloured dog.
OL,23,APub: 05-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
